stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Constructed
  Constructed --> Initializing
  Initializing --> Configuring
  Configuring --> RegisteringServices
  RegisteringServices --> ResolvingDependencies
  ResolvingDependencies --> Validating
  Validating --> RuntimeFreeze
  RuntimeFreeze --> Starting
  Starting --> Running
  Running --> Stopping
  Stopping --> Stopped
  Stopped --> Destroyed
  Destroyed --> [*]

  state "Registering Services" as RegisteringServices
  state "Resolving Dependencies" as ResolvingDependencies
  state "Runtime Freeze" as RuntimeFreeze

  Initializing --> Failed: failure
  Configuring --> Failed: failure
  RegisteringServices --> Failed: failure
  ResolvingDependencies --> Failed: failure
  Validating --> Failed: failure
  Starting --> Failed: failure
  Running --> Failed: failure
  Stopping --> Failed: failure
  Failed --> Rollback
  Rollback --> Destroyed

  note right of RuntimeFreeze
    Validated runtime structure
    is immutable after freeze.
  end note

  note right of Failed
    A lifecycle failure enters Failed.
    Rollback performs deterministic cleanup.
  end note
